<title>INDIA: India M&amp;M 1996/97 net seen up 23.7 pct.</title>
<headline>India M&amp;M 1996/97 net seen up 23.7 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tractor and utility vehicles maker Mahindra and Mahindra (M&amp;M) is likely to see its net profit rise 23.72 percent to 2.08 billion rupees in the year ended March 31, 1997, a Reuter poll said.</p>
<p>Projections by analysts at 28 leading securities and brokerage firms ranged from 1.85 billion rupees to 2.32 billion rupees against 1.68 billion in 1995/96.</p>
<p>.</p>
<p>M &amp; M    ----PAT seen up 23.72%, sales up 2.22%</p>
<p>			Net profit  1995/96     Net sales  1995/96</p>
<p>				 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>Average		2,079.53  1,680.80    29,638.67  28,995.60</p>
<p>High		   2,323.00		  35,858.00</p>
<p>Low		    1,850.00		  27,294.00</p>
